eet those who believe, they say, \"We believe\"; but when they are alone with their evil ones, they say, \"Indeed, we are with you; we were only mockers.\"","j":1,"h":1,"s":2,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"2:15","t":"[But] Allāh mocks them and prolongs them in their transgression [while] they wander blindly.","j":1,"h":1,"s":2,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"2:16","t":"Those are the ones who have purchased error [in exchange] for guidance, so their transaction has brought no profit, nor were they guided.","j":1,"h":1,"s":2,"a":16,"sd":null}],"juz":1,"hizb":1,"surahs":[2],"sajdah":false}